ated":"2026-10-14T14:13:43.254-0500","size":79416,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62331","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62331"},{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/62333","id":"62333","filename":"D1-design-tech_view-1440.png","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"created":"2026-10-14T14:13:45.257-0500","size":176983,"mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/content/62333","thumbnail":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/attachment/thumbnail/62333"}],"description":"h3. What\n\nTech View keeps the List's production status pill and its red and blue counts, but the pill's size follows the density setting.\n\nh3. Expected\n\nS2-R19: Tech View's Status column is the same status pill List shows in production, with the same red service-actions count and blue parts-actions count on it. S6-R2a (v58, unchanged since v54): \"In Tech View the status pill is 16px tall at Compact and Regular and 22px tall at Comfortable, the design’s small and regular badges. List’s status pill is unchanged: for the same work orders on the same page, every List pill is the same width and height as in production, including production’s matching widths down the column (for example, Approved as wide as Ready For Review when both are on the page). Tech View’s pill takes the same widths as List’s; only its height follows density.\"\n\nPRD: [Board View & Tech View PRD v58|https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=845185030] (page 845185030, version 58, read 16 Oct 2026) (S2-R19, S6-R2a). Product owner answer: Chris Ward, answer 15 (15 Oct 2026): \"16px at Compact and Regular, 22px at Comfortable, as the design draws it.\"\n\nh3. Actual (staging build, develop b19269d4487, clicked through locally)\n\nThe status pill is the same size (about 21px) at every density.\n\n* Still the same on staging {{v26.40.18-7d85b7d}}, 16 Oct 2026: the pill is 21 px tall at Compact, Regular and Comfortable (test C590115); the target is 16 px, 16 px and 22 px.\n\nh3. How to check\n\n* Compact and Regular: status pill 16px tall. Comfortable: 22px tall.\n* Red and blue counts still show on the pill, with their tooltips.\n* List's status pill looks exactly as in production.\n\nh3. Screenshots\n\nAttached: staging build first, Branko's design (files starting D) after.\n\nRaised from Sasha's staging review, 2026-10-14.\n\nh3. PRD v54 update (2026-10-15)\n\n* S6-R2a corrected: 16px at Compact and Regular (was 18px, which came from an unused badge in the design system), 22px at Comfortable. List pills keep production's sizes, including the matching widths down the column; Tech View's pill takes the same widths.\n\nAlso check:\n\n* Tech View pill is 16px at Compact and Regular, 22px at Comfortable.\n* Pill widths match List's production widths for the same work orders.\n\n----\n\n*Test cases for this design issue:*\n\n* [C590115|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590115] Tech View status pill is List's pill, 16 px tall, 22 px at Comfortable\n* [C590128|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/590128] Density changes Tech View row, avatar and bar sizes but never the text size\n* [C598326|https://shopview.testrail.io/index.php?/cases/view/598326] List status pills keep matching widths and Tech View pills take the same widths","reporter":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","16x16":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","32x32":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png"},"displayName":"Chris Ward","active":true,"timeZone":"America/Bogota","accountType":"atlassian"},"comment":{"comments":[{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/issue/57811/comment/78731","id":"78731","author":{"self":"https://shopview.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/user?accountId=712020%3Aaa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","accountId":"712020:aa00b8d6-a71f-4259-8919-82a304227c20","avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-1.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/b59acd73249e0b9e1cc3b64c79748f37?d=https%3A%2F%2F